# SquadSquabble

A self-hosted Family Fued game platform for family events using:
- Node.js backend
- React-based Game Board and Host UIs
- ESP32 physical buzzer faceoff buttons

## Structure
- `backend/`: Game server & APIs
- `game-board-ui/`: Display screen for TV
- `host-ui/`: Tablet interface for game control
- `esp32-buzzer/`: Microcontroller code for faceoff buttons